Z||000004||Monkeyman||12-10-1999||04:02 AM||||I believe you need the entire wiring harness up to the front firewall for a conversion to the later style.  Make sure you get everything as the later style had an extra (different) module, too.  The big advantage to the newer ones is that it only costs about $10US to rebuild both.  If you're gonna spend some money to convert to the newer style, may I suggest you spend a little extra and buy Toms' kit?  His is a non-pop up deal in case you aren't aware.  I'll be upgrading to his kit in the spring.  Just my opinion.||||reg||1
